{"entities":[{"descriptions":{"en":"A silent, pistol-style Amp for the Drifter. Generates its own ammunition from Void energy. A precisely timed reload over-charges the next shot.","zh":"（英文：SIROCCO）一款为漂泊者设计的手枪式消音增幅器。从虚空能量中汲取弹药。在精准的时机进行装填会使下一次射击获得额外充能。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Weapons/Operator/Pistols/DrifterPistol/DrifterPistolPlayerWeapon","key":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps|/Lotus/StoreItems/Weapons/Operator/Pistols/DrifterPistol/DrifterPistolPlayerWeapon","names":{"en":"Sirocco","zh":"赤风"},"provenance":[[0,0],[1,0]],"section":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"A custom Amplifier made from many possible parts. Assembled by:\r\nQuill Onkko in Cetus\r\nLittle Duck in Fortuna","zh":"一把从许多种可选部件中挑选组合而成的自定义增幅器。由他们来组装：\r\n希图斯的夜羽昂克\r\n福尔图娜的小鸭子"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Weapons/Sentients/OperatorAmplifiers/OperatorAmpWeapon","key":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps|/Lotus/StoreItems/Weapons/Sentients/OperatorAmplifiers/OperatorAmpWeapon","names":{"en":"Amp","zh":"增幅器"},"provenance":[[0,1],[1,1]],"section":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Amps concentrate and modify an Operator's Void Beam. This starting amp is powerful but lacks the flexibility of assembled amps.","zh":"增幅器能集中并改变一名指挥官的虚空射线。这个初始增幅器很强大，但是缺乏了装配增幅器的灵活性。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Weapons/Sentients/OperatorAmplifiers/SentTrainingAmplifier/OperatorTrainingAmpWeapon","key":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps|/Lotus/StoreItems/Weapons/Sentients/OperatorAmplifiers/SentTrainingAmplifier/OperatorTrainingAmpWeapon","names":{"en":"Mote Amp","zh":"微尘增幅器"},"provenance":[[0,2],[1,2]],"section":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}}],"entityEncoding":"shared-provenance-v1","model":"regional-catalog-v5","region":"international","schemaVersion":1,"section":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps","sources":[{"locale":"en","path":"exports/en/ExportClientInventory.json","section":"ClientInventoryOperatorAmps","sha256":"8d